+### B01 configuration-only acceptance
+
+The owner may adopt `sequence.b01_setup_ref` through
+`ResearchProgram.adopt_b01_setup(project_id, policy_ref, expected_revision=...)`
+at a quiet B01 boundary. This binds the instruction, target and real setup
+report, supplies identical setup criteria to worker and reviewer, and records
+the policy in acceptance. Dataset identity, executor provenance, environment
+configuration and a successful import/startup receipt complete setup; scientific
+scoring remains pending for B03/the scoring operation. See
+`skills/research-autopilot/references/b01-upstream-setup.md`.
+
+A setup-only result with no tasks retains the exact accepted decision rather
+than generating a new inquiry for configuration bookkeeping. No native result
+or new child work takes this shortcut. Later scientific admission is unchanged.
+Historical Skill/catalog bytes are retained when adopting this scoped policy.
+
